				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna</strong> disclose the cover of her <strong>Official 2015 Calendar</strong>. Her new pic with a bottle is absolutely iconic!</p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> tagged Nicki Minaj, her stylist Arianne Phillips, her manager Guy Oseary, her hair-stylist Andy LeCompte and her make-up artist Gina Brooke.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>Poppin Bottles&#8230;&#8230;See for yourself in my new calendar on <a href="http://www.madonna.com" target="_blank">madonna.com</a>! Pre order now! #bitchimmadonna</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Madonna</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>Another track that is likely to be included on the final tracklist of <strong>Madonna&#8217;s upcoming album</strong> is <strong>Bitch, I&#8217;m Madonna</strong>. She keeps on using this tag&#8230; <em>but this time it&#8217;s for a specific reason</em>&#8230;</p>
<a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/iconic-then-and-now.png"><img class="alignnone size-large wp-image-2104" src="http://drownedmadonna.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/iconic-then-and-now-1024x412.png" alt="Madonna Bitch I'm Madonna" width="960" height="386" /></a>
